            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Clasp 0.1.7

- One Universal app for Apple Silicon and Intel Macs running macOS 13.3 or later.
- Clear drag-to-Applications installer and a first-install guide on the Clasp website.
- Verified Sparkle update packaging using Clasp's existing update-signing key.
- Existing Clips and settings remain stored separately from the app.

This is an ad-hoc-signed, unnotarized alpha. Apple has not verified it. Only approve opening it if you trust its source. Manual app replacement remains available if automatic updating fails.
]]></description>
